      "basis": "VSCodeVim 1.32.4 src/textobject/textobject.ts L573-595 ([0,0] to the end of line 3, skipping the empty line 4); src/mode/modeHandler.ts L866-876 moves a stop at a line end through the line break, here to [4,0]"
