      "basis": "the sample is VSCodeVim's default leader \\ (the sandbox sets no vim.leader); VSCodeVim 1.32.4 src/actions/plugins/camelCaseMotion.ts L11-29 and src/actions/plugins/easymotion/easymotion.cmd.ts L31-95 (easymotion actions check vim.easymotion only when run), so the key is a prefix and VSCodeVim waits"
